# Runtime Python dependencies — mirrors [project.dependencies] in pyproject.toml.
# Kept as a separate file so non-uv tooling (Docker, Render/Fly/Railway buildpacks,
# plain VPS) can `pip install -r requirements.in` without parsing pyproject.toml.
# When you change pyproject.toml, mirror the change here.

